.Dd February 3, 2026
.Dt PORT-MATROID-TOOL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm port-matroid-tool
.Nd offline validation and audit utilities for port-matroid
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm validate Ar file
.Nm
.Cm audit Ar data-dir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm provides offline utilities for validating and auditing port-matroid data.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm validate Ar file
Validate and decode a snapshot (.csnp), workset (.workset), routing context (.ctx),
or network message (.msg). Exits non-zero on failure.
.It Cm audit Ar data-dir
Read the current snapshot and WAL from .Ar data-dir, replay WAL deterministically,
and report integrity status.
Output includes generation, WAL entry count, and WAL format version.
.El
.Sh NOTES
The runtime storage persistence format (manifest, snapshots, WAL) is defined in
.Pa dev-docs/STORAGE-FORMAT.md .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr port-matroidd 1 ,
.Xr port-matroidctl 1 ,
.Xr port-matroid.conf 5
